/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Breast cancer is classified as the most common cause of deaths among malignant tumor diseases. This project aimed to explore drug repurposing via machine learning models such as QSAR modeling. QSAR model was built on pEC50 values through the series of steps mentioned in the methodology. We chose to build on pEC50 values, because unlike EC50 values, these values do not have units therefore models built on such values can be interpreted and validated with reduced possibility of error. One of the intentions of our project was to find potential drug compounds that can be tested based on their aqueous solubility in in vitro experiments, therefore we obtained a dataset which could translate into molecular descriptors related to solubility \(logS\). Experimentally determined aqueous solubility of a compound is an important factor in determining the efficacy of the drug compounds \(Sorkun et al., 2019\). )
/Pg 57 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
